    "detailed_description": "Help Elena's grandma retrieve her precious memories from the past in Memoria! A compelling <strong>story-driven</strong> adventure through grandma's neighbourhood. Dive into unique <strong>2.5D platformer</strong> challenges located in the mysterious past to collect grandma's memories.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Exploration</h2><br>Explore grandma's neighborhood as Elena, a curious grandchild who likes to visit her grandma every summer! Discover the secrets in grandma's detailed house and learn about everything through playful interactions, compelling conversations and intriguing visuals.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1790880/extras/45184d5ac60c3a18f8bd852f690320b2.poster.avif?t=1635780932\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1790880/extras/45184d5ac60c3a18f8bd852f690320b2.webm?t=1635780932\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1790880/extras/45184d5ac60c3a18f8bd852f690320b2.mp4?t=1635780932\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Story</h2><br>Dive into an immersive story-line with a strong socially oriented message about a granddaughter trying to care for her grandmother.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1790880/extras/8e4215e8a45f26856410b5cc4941f9ee.poster.avif?t=1635780932\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1790880/extras/8e4215e8a45f26856410b5cc4941f9ee.webm?t=1635780932\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1790880/extras/8e4215e8a45f26856410b5cc4941f9ee.mp4?t=1635780932\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Challenge</h2><br>Help Elena care for her grandmother by collecting memories! You have to overcome intense and unique challenges to collect these memories from mysterious places located in the past!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1790880/extras/a039dff1a765d66d81d5bdab4c9f8d80.poster.avif?t=1635780932\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1790880/extras/a039dff1a765d66d81d5bdab4c9f8d80.webm?t=1635780932\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1790880/extras/a039dff1a765d66d81d5bdab4c9f8d80.mp4?t=1635780932\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
